 여러 중분류 선택이 가능합니다.\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</b>\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t<div style=\"text-align: right\">\r\n\t\t<a href=\"javascript:fncSearch();\" class=\"btns btnBlue\">연구동향보기 ▼</a>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t<!-- } 연구동향보기 박스 -->\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<!-- 분야 인용지수 -->\r\n\t\t<div class=\"sectionbox bggray\" id=\"majorCitationList\" style=\"display: none\">\r\n\t\t<h4>\r\n\t\t<em>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<b class=\"colorOrange researchName\"></b> 분야 인용지수\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</em>\r\n\t\t</h4>\r\n\t\t<p class=\"subcomment\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<span id=\"citationYear\"></span>년 기준 <span class=\"middMajorNm\"></span>분야 인용지수입니다.<br />\r\n\t\t<a href=\"../statistics/poStatisticsMain.kci?tab_code=Tab5\" class=\"colorBlue\" target=\"_blank\">통계 &gt; 학술지 인용통계</a>에서 전체 분야의 인용지수를 제공합니다.\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<span class=\"righttxt alignRight\" style=\"top:0px\">\r\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btns greenBtn h24px\" onclick=\"lf_exceldown();\">\r\n\t\t<span><i class=\"far fa-file-excel\"></i>&nbsp;엑셀</span>\r\n\t\t</button>\r\n\t\t<button type=\"button\" class=\"btns darkGrayBtn h24px\" onclick=\"lf_print_win();\">\r\n\t\t<span><i class=\"far fa-print\"></i>&nbsp;인쇄</span>\r\n\t\t</button>\r\n\t\t</span>\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t<div id=\"majorCitationListResult\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div id=\"reSearchTrend\"></div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<div class=\"sectionbox topic\" style=\"display: none;\">\r\n<!-- \t\t<h4><em>Topic Landscape in <b class=\"colorOrange researchName\"></b></em></h4> -->\r\n\t\t<h4><em>Topic Landscape in <b class=\"colorOrange\">공학 &gt; 항공우주공학</b></em></h4>\r\n\t\t<p class=\"subcomment topic\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\tTopic Landscape 분석은 AI 분석 기술을 이용하여 KCI 논문 키워드 간의 관계를 분석한 결과를 제공하는 기능입니다.<br/>\r\n\t\t맵 상에 고도는 키워드의 출현 빈도수가 많고 적은 것을 의미하며 키워드 간의 거리는 키워드의 상관 관계를 나타냅니다.\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t<iframe src=\"https://translate.kci.go.kr/topic/topic/map.do?work_seq=58\" title=\"Topic Landscape\" style=\"overflow: visible;\" width=\"100%\" height=\"600px\" frameborder='0' marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\"></iframe>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t</div>\r\n\t\r\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\t\r\n\t\t$(\"#fieldTempD04\").prop(\"checked\", true);\r\n\t\r\n\r\n\t\r\n\t\tfncMajorCitationList();\r\n\t\tfncReSearchTrend();\r\n\t\t$(\".sectionbox.topic\").show();\r\n\t\r\n\t\r\n\t$(function(){\r\n\t\t$(\"#fieldTemp\").on(\"click\", function() {\r\n\t\tif($(\"#fieldTemp\").prop(\"checked\")){\r\n\t\t$(\"input[id^='fieldTemp']\").prop(\"checked\", true);\r\n\t\t}else {\r\n\t\t$(\"input[id^='fieldTemp']\").prop(\"checked\", false);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t});\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t$(\"input[id^='fieldTemp']\").on(\"click\", function(e) {\r\n\t\tif(!$(e.target).prop(\"checked\")){\r\n\t\tif($(\"#fieldTemp\").prop(\"checked\")){\r\n\t\t$(\"#fieldTemp\").prop(\"checked\", false);\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t}\r\n\t\t});\r\n\t});\r\n\t</script>\r\n\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t</div>\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<style>\r\n.chatbot-icobox {position: fixed;bottom: 50px;left: calc(50% + 700px);z-index: 98;animation: chatbotMove 1s ease-in-out 0s infinite alternate;}\r\n.chatbot-icobox:hover {animation: none;}\r\n.chatbot-icobox .chatbot-icobox-hide-btn {position: absolute;top: 0;left: 0;display: block;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 50%;}\r\n.chatbot-icobox .chatbot-open-btn {display: block;overflow: hidden;border-radius: 10px;font-size: 0;}\r\n.chatbot-icobox img{max-width: 93px}\r\n@keyframes chatbotMove {0% { transform:translateY(0);}100% { transform:translateY(-15px);}}\r\n</style>\r\n<aside class=\"chatbot-icobox\">\r\n\t<a href=\"javascript:$('.chatbot-icobox').fadeOut('fast');\" class=\"chatbot-icobox-hide-btn\" title=\"챗봇 아이콘 닫기\"><img src=\"/kciportal/resources/newkci/image/kor/chatbot_closebtn.png\" alt=\"닫기 아이콘\"/></a>\r\n\t<a href=\"http://pf.kakao.com/_xfymxaxj/chat\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"카카오 챗봇 새창 연결\" class=\"chatbot-open-btn\"><img src=\"/kciportal/resources/newkci/image/kor/icon/chatbot_img.png\" alt=\"KCI 챗봇\"/></a>\r\n</aside>\r\n<!-- 하단 푸터 { -->\r\n<div id=\"footer\">\r\n\t<div class=\"respon\">\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<ul class=\"nopm floats\">\r\n\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"https://www.nrf.re.kr/page/409?menuNo=409\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong>개인정보 처리방침</strong></a></li>\r\n\t\t<li><a href=\"http://www.nrf.re.kr/member/not_email\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">이메일 자동수집 거부</a></li>\r\n\t\t<li>문의사항 042-869-6674, 6675 , E-mail : <a href=\"mailto:kciadmin@nrf.re.kr\">kciadmin@nrf.re.kr</a></li>\r\n\t\t</ul>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<p class=\"footinfo\">\r\n\t\t관리 책임자 : 연구데이터분석팀 팀장 조석민<br/>\r\n\t\t관리 담당자 : 연구데이터분석팀 담당 조선희<br/>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t<span>[34113] 대전광역시 유성구 가정로 201 한국연구재단</span>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\n\t\t</p>\r\n\t\t<p class=\"copyright\">Copyright(c) 2014 NRF ALL Right Reserved. Contact us for more information.</p>\r\n\t\t\r\n\t</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<!-- } 하단 푸터 -->\r\n\t\r\n\t<script type=\"text/javascript\">\r\n\tvar screenSize = window.screen.availWidth + \"*\" + window.screen.availHeight;\r\n\t  var cpuClass = window.navigator.cpuClass;\r\n\t  var platform = window.navigator.platform;\r\n\t  if (typeof (cpuClass) == 'undefined') {\r\n\t    if (platform == \"Win32\") {\r\n\t      cpuClass = \"x86\";\r\n\t    } else if (platform == \"Win64\") {\r\n\t      cpuClass = \"x64\";\r\n\t    }\r\n\t  }\r\n\r\n\t  var referrer = document.referrer;\r\n\t  var idx = referrer.indexOf(\"referrer=\");\r\n\t  if (idx > 0) {\r\n\t    referrer = referrer.substring(idx + 9, referrer.length);\r\n\t    referrer = decodeURIComponent(referrer);\r\n\t  }\r\n\t  (function($) {\r\n\t\t \r\n\t\t \r\n\r\n\r\n// \t\t$.ajax({\r\n\r\n// \t\tasync : \"false\",\r\n// \t\ttype:\"POST\",\r\n// \t\tdata : {\r\n// \t\treferrer : referrer,\r\n// \t\tscreenSize : screenSize,\r\n// \t\tcpuClass : cpuClass,\r\n\r\n// \t\t},\r\n// \t\tsuccess : function(data){},\r\n// \t\terror: function(data){}\r\n// \t\t});\r\n\r\n\t\